1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 2=

10
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:50,100
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

11
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,150
Mother,

12
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:55,670
we cannot keep that country girl.

13
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,920
Brother, stop talking.

14
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:59,710
Three lives were lost in a single night.

15
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:01,470
Her adoptive parents
died because of her.

16
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,600
She is a jinx.

17
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,280
Three lives?

18
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,430
Yes.

19
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:13,640
Mother,

20
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,350
please don't blame Yuan.

21
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:18,200
It's all my fault for taking her place,

22
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,430
causing her to wander in the countryside

23
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:21,920
and get mixed up in trouble.

24
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,040
Jin,

25
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,840
what does this have to do with you?

26
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:26,430
Mother,

27
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,560
she is cursed with ill fortune.

28
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:30,310
Three lives...

29
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:32,350
If word of this gets out,

30
00:01:32,710 --> 00:01:34,120
how can our household save face?

31
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:38,350
Look, Mother.

32
00:01:38,510 --> 00:01:40,150
This is an ill omen.

33
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:45,590
Nice snap.

34
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,760
Mother is the most superstitious.

35
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,760
The thorn of doubt
has been planted in her heart.

36
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,430
Look, Jin.

37
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,430
Even Heaven is helping us.

38
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:56,310
(Heaven?)

39
00:01:56,510 --> 00:01:58,590
(I swapped the silk threads myself.)

40
00:01:59,150 --> 00:01:59,840
Jin,

41
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,230
don't worry.

42
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,070
I will help you drive her away.

43
00:02:03,710 --> 00:02:06,640
You are the only
young lady of this residence.

44
00:02:07,790 --> 00:02:09,680
As long as I can stay by your side,

45
00:02:09,870 --> 00:02:10,960
I am content.

46
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,590
But what are you going to do?

47
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,000
Such a jinx...

48
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,590
If we brought her back,

49
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:20,750
wouldn't it ruin our household

50
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:21,800
and bring disaster to the whole family?

51
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,560
Send her back now.

52
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:29,910
(In my past life, you despised me
for a ruined reputation.)

53
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:32,870
(In this life, I am innocent,
yet still rejected.)

54
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,080
(I never cared for this.)

55
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:36,750
(Why would I need your pity?)

56
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,560
Father.

57
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:40,520
Good.

58
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:43,630
It's good that you're back.

59
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:46,520
Your grandparents are
in our hometown of Qingzhou

60
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,470
and will return in a few days.

61
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:49,120
Let me introduce everyone to you first.

62
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,560
This is your mother,

63
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,870
your cousin Han Yue'e,

64
00:02:51,870 --> 00:02:53,240
your elder brother Qi Zhao,

65
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:55,120
and your younger sister Qi Jin.

66
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,240
(In my past life,)

67
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:06,710
(I thought returning to the Qi family)

68
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:07,960
(meant claiming my true identity.)

69
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:10,150
(I never expected
that losing my reputation)

70
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:11,360
(would make me an outcast to everyone,)

71
00:03:11,590 --> 00:03:13,240
(or that Qi Jin would frame me)

72
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,430
(and have my legs broken.)

73
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,590
(Qi Jin,)

74
00:03:18,430 --> 00:03:20,120
(we meet again.)

75
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,590
You don't even know how
to greet me, who is your elder brother?

76
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,560
So ill-mannered.

77
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:28,400
The young lady
grew up in the countryside.

78
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:31,190
(Nanny Zhang, Qi Residence Maid)
Her etiquette is bound to be lacking.

79
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,630
Greetings, Father,

80
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,910
Mother,

81
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,000
Cousin,

82
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,630
Brother,

83
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,710
and Jin.

84
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,360
Your etiquette follows palace protocol.

85
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:56,220
(Qi Zhen, Marquis Yongping)
Father,

86
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,080
when I was chopping wood
on Mount Baiyun,

87
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,560
I met an elderly nanny.

88
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,960
She was the one who taught me.

89
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,430
Mount Baiyun?

90
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:04,120
Was...

91
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,800
Was that nanny's surname Jiang?

92
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,190
Nanny Jiang

93
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,710
is her maidservant.

94
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:13,000
The Eldest Princess.

95
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:18,310
Her Highness lives
in secluded meditation,

96
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,720
and many noble families are turned away.

97
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:22,480
That's rare

98
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,750
to earn her favor.

99
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,310
Brother,

100
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,750
hurry up and present

101
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:28,680
the welcome gift we prepared for Yuan.

102
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,310
Right.

103
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:30,950
Right...

104
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:31,830
Come.

105
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,360
Take it.

106
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:37,870
(As expected,)

107
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,070
(it's the same)

108
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,190
(dirty tricks again.)

109
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:42,830
Brother,

110
00:04:43,310 --> 00:04:44,630
the gift you and Jin gave

111
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,040
is precious.

112
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,240
Good.

113
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,800
Someone, help!

114
00:04:58,860 --> 00:05:00,560
- Help us!
- Someone come quickly!

115
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,270
Someone, help!

116
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:07,830
Where did this come from?

117
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,160
Madam!

118
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,000
Mother,

119
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,750
Jin,

120
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,160
be careful.

121
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,560
- Someone, help.
- Help us.

122
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:33,950
Someone, help.

123
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,270
(Xiao Yunting?)

124
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:47,630
(Why is he here?)

125
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,600
Qi Yuan, put the knife down.

126
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,070
Greetings, Prince Jing.

127
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,750
I was unaware of Your Highness's visit.

128
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:57,040
I failed to handle
my family's private matter properly

129
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,240
and startled Your Highness.

130
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,070
Pay your respects to Prince Jing now.

131
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:04,560
- Greetings, Prince Jing.
- Greetings, Prince Jing.

132
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,630
It happened so suddenly.

133
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,560
How could the Marquis foresee this?

134
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:08,510
It is fine.

135
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:10,040
Rise.

136
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,430
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

137
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,190
May I ask, Your Highness,

138
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:15,240
what brings you here today?

139
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:19,360
I have been unwell,

140
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,430
and Father said

141
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,830
that the hot springs at your residence
are best for healing.

142
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,270
So he wished for me

143
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:25,630
to stay at
your residence for a few days.

144
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,800
So it was ordered by the Crown Prince.

145
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:30,600
Please follow me
to the Hot Spring Courtyard.

146
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:31,600
I will lead the way.

147
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,310
No rush.

148
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:34,680
A beast disturbed the inner courtyard.

149
00:06:34,950 --> 00:06:35,950
Though it is a family matter,

150
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,630
it concerns

151
00:06:37,630 --> 00:06:39,040
the safety and order of your estate.

152
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,870
Marquis, you should settle it first.

153
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,310
Your Highness, please hear me out.

154
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:49,310
It is my sister who just returned home.

155
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,360
She was raised in
a butcher's home since childhood,

156
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,560
and she can't wash off that foul stench.

157
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,270
The beast was likely coming for her.

158
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,070
Qi Yuan,

159
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,920
are you insane?

160
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:01,390
You...

161
00:07:03,870 --> 00:07:04,430
Yuan,

162
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:06,750
how could you hit someone
in front of Prince Jing?

163
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:08,600
What are you doing, Qi Yuan?

164
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:09,270
Outrageous!

165
00:07:09,270 --> 00:07:10,120
Your Highness,

166
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:12,630
this matter concerns
the very foundation of our Qi family.

167
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,390
I overstepped today,

168
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,480
but I had no choice.

169
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:18,000
How does it concern our foundation?

170
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,480
This is called Hehuan Vine.

171
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,040
Ground into powder

172
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,120
and mixed into incense,

173
00:07:30,830 --> 00:07:32,040
it is harmless to humans,

174
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:35,390
but beasts will chase it wildly.

175
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,920
I didn't want to expose this,

176
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,680
but Your Highness is here.

177
00:07:40,950 --> 00:07:42,800
Your Highness is sharp-eyed.

178
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,750
How could you not see
through such a petty trick?

179
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:49,740
(Liujin, Prince Jing's attendant)

180
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,830
I don't know.

181
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,630
The ingredients for this incense

182
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:06,630
were all bought
by the servants Zhao sent.

183
00:08:11,310 --> 00:08:11,920
Yes,

184
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,120
but I don't know anything
about Hehuan Vine either.

185
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:17,070
Then I must ask you, Zhao.

186
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,560
What kind of servant

187
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,160
could afford five taels of silver

188
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:22,360
to buy such rare Hehuan Vine?

189
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:25,070
If anyone doubts this price,

190
00:08:25,190 --> 00:08:27,190
you may freely
ask around on the streets.

191
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:32,480
Father,

192
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:37,360
the Emperor is currently intent
on reforming the nobility

193
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,600
and curbing hereditary titles.

194
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,670
Countless eyes out there

195
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,080
are watching our Qi family.

196
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,030
Yet look at them.

197
00:08:44,510 --> 00:08:46,910
One is the heir
of the Marquis Residence,

198
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:48,600
and the other is
a noble lady of the capital.

199
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,200
In their own courtyard,

200
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,910
they committed such a vile act,

201
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,150
framing their own blood

202
00:08:53,150 --> 00:08:54,480
and frightening the primary mother.

203
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:55,960
If I hadn't stepped in,

204
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,510
it would have misled
His Highness into thinking

205
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:59,440
this is how the Qi family
conducts itself.

206
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,360
If this reaches His Majesty,

207
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:04,000
how much of the Qi family's
reputation and hereditary title

208
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:06,000
could remain intact?

209
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:12,440
Young Lady Qi, you have
a keen insight into court dynamics

210
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,790
and act with decisive strength.

211
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,960
Marquis Yongping,

212
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:17,510
you have a fine daughter.

213
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,790
Just for these words of hers,

214
00:09:20,150 --> 00:09:21,670
she ought to be handsomely rewarded.

215
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:22,320
However,

216
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,150
those who deserve punishment
must also be punished.

217
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:26,840
Your Highness is right.

218
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:29,670
The finest courtyard in my residence

219
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,120
is Mingyue Pavilion.

220
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:34,510
Let Yuan move in there from now on.

221
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:36,270
Furthermore,

222
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,240
Nanny Zhang previously

223
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,750
served my wife,

224
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,670
so send her over

225
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:42,840
to serve Yuan.

226
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,960
As for this unfilial son...

227
00:09:47,550 --> 00:09:48,150
Come,

228
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,550
drag him to the ancestral hall

229
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,550
and flog him according to family rules.

230
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,000
And you.

231
00:09:53,910 --> 00:09:55,240
This has nothing to do with Jin.

232
00:09:55,390 --> 00:09:56,480
I did it all alone.

233
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,390
You did it all alone?

234
00:09:59,150 --> 00:10:00,720
Then go confess your guilt yourself.

235
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,720
Your Highness,

236
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:13,390
please accompany me
to the Hot Spring Courtyard.

237
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,910
We are hosting
a welcome feast for you tonight.

238
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,080
Please do us the honor of attending.

239
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:16,910
This way.

240
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:24,960
(She threw the Qi family into chaos
as soon as she returned.)

241
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,320
(She is quite a formidable character.)

242
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:30,550
(In my past life,)

243
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:33,510
(when I was at my most desperate,)

244
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,200
(you saved me.)

245
00:10:37,630 --> 00:10:38,550
(Who could have expected)

246
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:41,000
(that on our wedding day,)

247
00:10:41,510 --> 00:10:42,840
(you would trade your wife for glory)

248
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,360
(and offer me to Prince Qi?)

249
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:52,000
♪Still unable to step out of
this devout dream until the end of time♪

250
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:56,080
You love Xiao Yunting so much,

251
00:10:56,870 --> 00:10:59,120
yet he is nothing more
than a good-for-nothing

252
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,000
who trades his wife for glory.

253
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,080
(Now,)

254
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,630
(Heaven has given me another chance.)

255
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:09,390
(This time,)

256
00:11:10,390 --> 00:11:12,360
(I will never give my heart to you.)

257
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:17,880
♪Will the dark night collapse?♪

258
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:25,460
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

259
00:11:26,010 --> 00:11:30,440
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

260
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:33,540
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

261
00:11:33,690 --> 00:11:39,990
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

262
00:11:40,150 --> 00:11:45,940
♪Love is a miracle♪
